  <AltText>
    Sprite of NovaDragonSpirit's OC, Senán. He is a satyr with brown ears, dark brown hair, orange cervid-esque eyes, and brown and light brown legs with very dark grey hooves. He is wearing your traditional satyr garb that is green in colour, with brown details.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    A sprite of Senán!
    Never sprited a faun or a satyr, so this was quite fun! ^w^
